.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE OPTION ADD"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute option add \- Add an option to a select definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute option add [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add an option to a select definition
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ATTRIBUTE_KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --key
Stable option key (immutable after creation)
.TP
.B --label
Display label
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
